om/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/8d093f5e733cc58a364020c249e1c849.poster.avif?t=1749630548\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/8d093f5e733cc58a364020c249e1c849.webm?t=1749630548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you grind to the top of the delivery business? Gear up, hit the road, and prove your skills in <strong>Delivery Guy Simulator</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/b3c7c6cb2cac03801e71166aeaafcff3.poster.avif?t=1749630548\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/b3c7c6cb2cac03801e71166aeaafcff3.webm?t=1749630548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/b3c7c6cb2cac03801e71166aeaafcff3.mp4?t=1749630548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
